        "date": "2026-10-21T04:06:28Z"
      },
      "message": "ci(1440): hold merges while a person's decision is pending\n\npr-evidence turns red while a PR carries the needs-decision label and,\nwhile the label is on, disarms GitHub auto-merge on every run (labeled,\nunlabeled and auto_merge_enabled join the trigger); an unchecked\nAcceptance item adds the label. pr-evidence is now a required status\ncheck on main (pinned to the Actions app), and a zero-dependency shape\ngate keeps it load-bearing: no job-level if or name, no paths filter,\nlabel triggers present.\n\nProcess (AGENTS.md, pr-pacman skill, ADR 0007 revision): disarm\nauto-merge, add the label, then ask; only a person removes the label.\n\n#1435 merged on 2026-10-21 while the user's decision was still open:\nauto-merge was armed, the orchestrator edited the Acceptance boxes green\nbefore asking, and pr-evidence was advisory then.\n\nFollow-up commits squashed in:\n\n* ci(1440): one run per PR, drafts stay unlabelled, gate reads block-form types\n* ci(1440): contents: write for disablePullRequestAutoMerge, loud disarm failure\n* ci(1440): read the PR from the API every run, judge drafts on ready_for_review\n* docs(1440): merge guard evidence from the live demo on #1441\n\ncloses #1440",
